% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% citations.clausal -- statutory citation records for sg/payments/psa_licence_class.
%
% citation/2 record form: a FACT, the key an atom, the second argument a
% pair list with keys label and ref only:
%   citation(Key, [label-'...', ref-'...']).
% Records carry a label and a link; quotations of the statute are omitted,
% see the linked Singapore Statutes Online (SSO) page for the text.
%
% A clause cites a key with a `cite(Key)` term; cite(...) is data and
% needs no import.
%
% PROVENANCE: every clause that decides a statutory condition or computes a
% statutory value (a threshold, a test, an exception, a classification, a
% list it filters by, a date or amount, a definition or interpretation rule
% it applies), helpers included, opens its body with implements(Key), Key
% the provision for THAT condition or value; the verdict clause's umbrella
% section does not cover the conditions below it. RECORD a key here for
% every such provision.
%
% Source: Payment Services Act 2019 (Singapore), current version as at
%         2 Oct 2026, Singapore Statutes Online.
% =====================================================================

:- module(citations, [
    citation/2,
    implements/1
]).

% --- Provisions returned in the CITATIONS list of psa_licence/4 ---

citation(sg_psa_2019_s5_1_b, [
    label-'Payment Services Act 2019 s 5(1)(b)',
    ref-'https://sso.agc.gov.sg/Act/PSA2019?ProvIds=pr5-'
]).

